    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deceit 2 is an online social deduction horror game. Inspire fear as the Infected, play detective as the Innocent, or create mayhem as the Cursed. Trapped with friends and strangers: who can you trust to help you escape? </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">THE TEAMS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064870/extras/efed69f25528484eb9166b71d5a4b370.avif?t=1751538184\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">THE INNOCENT: SURVIVE AND ESCAPE</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stay alive and outwit the Infected or meet a grim fate. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete tasks around the map to bring you closer to obtaining the escape key.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Investigate suspicious activity and keep an eye on your fellow players\u2019 actions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064870/extras/257e76b150ca91f7e67cffc3fc370814.avif?t=1751538184\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">THE INFECTED: DECEIVE AND KILL</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Transform and execute other players to whittle down the ranks of the Innocent.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover Mutation perks and give you even stronger powers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn the trust of your team: blend in and wait for the moment to strike.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064870/extras/b334b6941409972fe2b42a06b80ba154.avif?t=1751538184\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">THE CURSED: CONFUSION AND MAYHEM</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deceive Infected and Innocents alike and avoid suspicion. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Become a true agent of chaos, and exploit your curse to win the game your way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock ever stronger curses as you outwit friend and foe.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064870/extras/c9f597a732ff3bd62721a14ce1aa68cb.avif?t=1751538184\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">MASTER THE RITUAL</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Climb the ranks of Ascension to become a master of Deceit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new items to help you escape, and unleash new Mutations to give you an edge as the Infected.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expand your wardrobe with epic character and item cosmetics.</p></li></ul>",
